{"type":"text","timestamp":1794363897107,"sessionID":"ses_e37c0206bffe1WqCsLDh8xik5o","part":{"id":"prt_1c86c34f8001QJXb5h4LFHaQoq","messageID":"msg_1c86bbd3d001WPJqgUrjz2Ah4m","sessionID":"ses_e37c0206bffe1WqCsLDh8xik5o","type":"text","text":"Everything is done and verified. Final state:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`) — complete Flask API:\n- Auth: register/login/logout with DB-stored Bearer tokens\n- Entries CRUD with filters (`start_date`, `end_date`, `project`), paging, `date DESC, id DESC` order, cross-user isolation (404)\n- `GET /api/projects`, `GET /api/totals`, CSV exports (`entries.csv`, `summary.csv`) with exact headers, oldest-first order, CRLF line endings, OWASP apostrophe neutralization of `=+-@` cells\n- Serves `frontend/dist` at `/` with `/api` JSON-404 guard\n\n**Frontend** — React/TS/Vite/Tailwind4: auth screen, quick-entry form, filter bar, paginated entry table with inline edit/delete, per-project totals card, CSV export buttons (fetch+blob so the auth header is sent). `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` both pass; `npm ci` verified in sync with the lock.\n\n**Verification**\n- Full API suite: 51/51 checks passed on a fresh DB\n- Fresh server smoke test: register 201 → login → create → list → CSV (correct header, CRLF) → `/` 200, `/api/health` 200\n- Built assets confirmed served (`/assets/*.js`, `.css`), all Tailwind classes present in the bundle\n\nThe server is currently running at `http://127.0.0.1:8000` with a fresh `data/timesheet.db` (demo/secret123 account exists from the smoke test). Temp test script and old logs were removed.","time":{"start":1794363897080,"end":1794363897083}}}
